  "_comment": [
    "Hand-written reference spec v2 for test_vector_files/detal_126.png",
    "(Шпиндель обрабатывающего центра V-10, Сталь 55 ГОСТ 1050-2013, М 1:2, A3).",
    "",
    "Purpose: isolate the DRAFTER, exactly as v1 did. Every dimension here was",
    "read off the sheet by hand, so anything built wrong from this input is a",
    "builder defect and not a reading error.",
    "",
    "v2 adds the features v1 had to list in prose because the contract had no",
    "field for them. They are now data:",
    "  - the 7:24 taper of the bore (Ø56,55 large end) — bore[0].taper",
    "  - M54,5x2 on the Ø55 nose — outer[].thread (M75x1,5 is left out: a\n    thread's nominal is the outer diameter of the step it is cut on,\n    and this profile does not separate the step that carries it)",
    "  - both keyways, 85x12 and 35 — keyways[]",
    "  - the cross-holes Ø14, Ø10, Ø9 — cross_holes[]",
    "  - the 1x45° chamfers ('6 фасок') — chamfers[]",
    "",
    "HONEST LIMIT: the sheet dimensions these features from local datums that",
    "this file does not reproduce, so their AXIAL POSITIONS below are placed",
    "consistently with the profile rather than read off the drawing. Sizes are",
    "read; positions are constructed. A test may hold the builder to the sizes",
    "and to the fact that each feature is buildable where it is put — not to",
    "the positions as if they were measurements.",
    "",
    "Still out of reach, deliberately: the GD&T frames (0,008 Д, 0,03 Д) as",
    "geometry rather than annotation text, and the 2 отв. M8 of section Б-Б,",
    "which sit on a bolt circle the sheet gives in a view this spec omits."
  ],
